    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493650/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1724081529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493650/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1724081529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493650/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1724081529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Where do warriors, wizards, elves, orcs and general fantasy folk spend most of their time? Well, the tavern, of course!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1493650/extras/8bdc798def4df676d9f3f28cdebe5fd5.avif?t=1724081529\" /></div><br><br>Open your own tavern, serve all sorts of mighty heroes (and the occasional evil lords) and be fast to keep the beer flowing and the gold pouring at magical speeds!<br><br>Unlock new and fantastic lands to expand your beer empire opening new taverns to take quality ale to all corners of the world!<br><br>Featuring:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40+ levels and hundreds of customers;<br></li><li>Full controller support;<br></li><li>Play in 5 different worlds;<br></li><li>Originally composed soundtracks;</li></ul>",
